{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And they shall join.</b> A term of joining; and so מֵרֻכְסֵי אִישׁ (Psalms 31) — the joinings of the cords of the wicked; and so וְהָרְכָסִים לְבִקְעָה (Isaiah 40) — mountains pressed close to each other, such that one cannot descend into the valley between them except with great difficulty, for through their closeness the valley is steep and deep — let it become a valley of level ground and easy to traverse." "<b>To be upon the band of the ephod.</b> That the breastpiece be bound to the band of the ephod." "<b>And it shall not be loosened.</b> A term of tearing away; and it is an Arabic word, according to the words of Dunash ben Labrat."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:20.844481920Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}